[h2]预览范围[/h2]
本次预览构建含 5317 个贴图绑定，游戏贴图与其原版来源分辨率一致，高清生成原件另行完整保留。当前已知独立来源完成 5239/5485（95.52%，含 4 个非人物例外），另有新增来源和历史引用待处理。实机截图只证明已抽查位置的表现，不代表全部国家、人物、事件和界面已遍历。其他头像模组可能覆盖相同资源，请优先单独启用本模组测试。

[hr][/hr]
[h2]A little kindness in a strategy game[/h2]
[b]Development preview: the known portrait inventory is still being completed. Full coverage is not claimed, and public Workshop publication is currently on hold.[/b]

Hearts of Nailong gradually replaces real-person portraits that may carry real-world controversy with the friendly, harmless Nailong mascot. Clothing, hair, facial hair, poses and other visible details help each character retain an individual appearance.

This is a small creative wish for peace: oppose racial discrimination, respect human dignity, and keep differences of nationality, ethnicity and history from turning into hostility between players. We hope people from different backgrounds can share a laugh and enjoy a strategy game together. Cute portraits cannot solve real conflicts, but they can remind us to treat one another with kindness.

[h2]Keep fiction and reality distinct[/h2]
Countries, wars, characters and alternate paths in the game belong to its fictional experience. Gameplay choices and victories do not justify discrimination, hatred or the glorification of real harm. Please maintain a clear boundary between play and reality, respect fellow players, and avoid projecting fictional rivalries onto real communities.

[h2]Actual gameplay and current scope[/h2]
The images above are genuine screenshots from the rebuilt preview: France was played through 4 January 1936; the UK and USA were inspected in fresh starts. They are not AI-generated gameplay scenes.

This build contains 5317 texture bindings at their corresponding original game resolutions; unmodified HD generation masters are archived separately. The known inventory currently has 5239 of 5485 unique sources completed (95.52%, including four documented non-person exceptions). Newly discovered sources and historical unresolved references remain. Sampled screens do not establish exhaustive coverage of every country, character or event. Portrait mods that replace the same resources may conflict; test this preview on its own first.
